          }
        },
        "template--21341109289251__a9867fa9-3fef-4cdf-95fb-68334205580c-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<em>WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF CONSCIOUS MODERN LUXURY<\/em>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--21341109289251__a9867fa9-3fef-4cdf-95fb-68334205580c-richtext-1": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>A natural alignment to the brand’s ethos and underlying expression of conscious creativity, <strong>QUEEN BEE represents the fragile duality of life and death<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Hand crafted from semi-precious metals, enamel, and man-made gemstones, the designs mimic the species’ delicate features, capturing its fluidity of movement in motion.<\/p><p>Scientists have estimated that globally, 1 in 6 bee species is regionally extinct and more than 40 percent are vulnerable to extinction.<\/p><p>Honouring the immeasurable importance of bees and the role they posses in the preservation or destruction of life, this compelling collection is designed to evoke emotion and presents a literal provocation for change.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
